1300
01:52:15,420 --> 01:52:18,920
I'm just an ordinary woman
who will never give up on her happiness.

1301
01:52:20,750 --> 01:52:23,290
I told Vinay the other day, 

1302
01:52:23,960 --> 01:52:25,500
