1520
02:09:51,710 --> 02:09:53,580
He killed the real you.

1521
02:09:56,330 --> 02:09:58,880
And she revealed something at the end.

1522
02:09:58,960 --> 02:10:02,130
In 1996, as part of Gangadhar's backstory, 

1523
02:10:02,880 --> 02:10:05,630
