And you know who did it?

1525
02:10:08,750 --> 02:10:10,830
Mercury and his gang.

1526
02:10:11,500 --> 02:10:13,540
That's where this story began.

1527
02:10:13,630 --> 02:10:15,830
Mercury's robbery shattered a family

1528
